  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1187",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-18T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-18T12:17:15.371Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough), स्थानीय वायू तथा पूर्वीय वायूको समेत आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the partial influence of a western trough in the upper atmosphere, along with local winds and easterly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी प्रदेशमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश प्रदेश र अन्य हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल तथा तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा मधेश प्रदेशका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको समेत सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Madhesh Province and the remaining Hilly and Himalayan regions, while the Terai regions are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi Province, and at one or two places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Terai regions of Koshi Province and at one or two places in Madhesh Province. In addition, heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the Hilly region of Koshi Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग, लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भाग र मधेश प्रदेशको तराई  भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । अन्य तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा पनि मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा मधेश प्रदेशका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तातो लहर तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा पनि  तातो दिन हुने सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as the Himalayan region of Lumbini Province and the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly region of Lumbini Province and the Terai region of Madhesh Province, while the remaining Terai regions are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi Province, and at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the Terai regions of Koshi Province and at one or two places in Madhesh Province. Heatwave conditions are likely at some places in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while hot day conditions are also likely at some places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
}
